<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan industry output grows 7.1 pct in Aug.</title>
<headline>Moldovan industry output grows 7.1 pct in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's industrial output rose 7.1 percent in August, but was 17 percent lower than a year earlier, the State Statistics Department said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    MOLDOVAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT    Aug '96    July '96    Aug '95</p>
<p>    Monthly pct change		+7.1	 +21.5	+39.1</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	  -17	 +21.8	-15.3</p>
<p>Industrial production in the first eight months of the year was 4.5-percent higher than in January-August of 1995 after a 15.3-percent fall to the same period of 1994.</p>
<p>--Dmitry Solovyov, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
